# The free sample is made and saved on the reader: the shelf starts empty,
# Now playing names the sample with the honest firmware note where the sim
# has no audio backend, and the shelf keeps it afterwards.
wait-for Audiobooks
expect No audiobooks yet
clean
shot audiobook-empty
tap-id sample
wait-for Now playing
expect The Quiet Shelf
expect Saved on this reader
clean
shot audiobook-playing
tap back
wait-for Audiobooks
expect The Quiet Shelf
expect-missing No audiobooks yet
clean
shot audiobook-shelf
